  "question": {
    "text": "A baseband signal of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>MHz</mi></math> frequency is modulated with a carrier signal of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>GHz</mi></math> frequency using amplitude modulation method. What should be the minimum size of antenna required to transmit the modulated signal ?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The wavelength of the carrier wave is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>&#957;</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>.</p><p>The minimum size of the antenna required is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;of the wavelength of the carrier. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math></p>"
  }
